  "body": "The existing Chapter1 FTL guarantees use the proved empirical-mean comparator. This package produces the literal minimum over [0,1], identifies its real infimum with the attained mean loss, and connects signed best-fixed regret to the same shared comparatorRegret. Four derived producer/representation/order lemmas and two adapters express the existing4+4logT and initial1/4-plus-tail guarantees for the actual first1/2 strict-past meanPredict; these are not six printed theorems or new rate mathematics.\n\nThe prefix interval hypotheses and positive-horizon performance restrictions stay explicit. T0 is only an empty-prefix library extension without uniqueness. Arbitrary supplied prediction traces in the algebraic identities are separate from the causal strategy used in both performance endpoints. A fixed time-only alternating predictor on an independently fixed matching target stream has signed best regret -1/2 atT2; no min/expectation interchange follows.\n\nValidation: actual six public bodies, twenty named canaries,38standard-axiom checks, frozen actual type/definition identities,26native header guards and16compiled VALUE pairs; shared root9096jobs, Tests9251jobs, full harness472tests/7skips. The committed contributor gate covers five production paths/one contract. Applicable clean local site preserves10906old registry IDs/URLs/hashes and adds seven shared nodes; twelve current images were reviewed. Distinct automated decoder/source-reviewer history and exact CONTRACT/BODY/FINAL receipts are in runs/online-square-minimum-20261008. Header scans, compilation, semantic reviews, combined gates and publication are separate evidence.\n\nStacked on OPENdraft/unmerged PR192 exact2aa08b9e1f5da4d0c7d7dcbe9ddeadd1fbfc34e3 (base codex/research-online-no-regret). Only the pathwise square-minimum hinge is delivered. The minimum of expected fixed loss and causal IID cumulative variance benchmark remain REQUIRED next; five main-relative source-module audits are unwaived. Original16Chapter1source items/proof-totalnull, fullChapter1open, Chapter2incomplete, Chapters3–16unenumerated/necessaryappendices required, total GoalACTIVE. No main/live/merge/deploy/retirement claim.\n",
